    "Hostilefalse or doInsomniafalse returns before predecrement, friendly argument unused. Enabled --nextTick then ifnonpositive +=(60+nextInt60)*20 BEFORE global sky test. Fresh0 yields1199..2379stored, ordinary later crossing from1 to0 adds1200..2380; no walltime guarantee. Bright failure consumes scheduled opportunity; disabled delivery freezes.",
    "Global skyDarken<5 with hasSkyLight rejects before players/event. Currentplayers then spectatorfilter only, no own alive/creative/sleep filter. GameRule registration defaulttrue actual65read; loaded current rule unproved. Per-player local DifficultyInstance and initial1+nextInt(baseDifficultyId+1) created before event.",
    "Whole event has HasResult and mutable intcount getter/setter with no clamp. It has no own Cancelable annotation; baseevent/bus/fullhandler composition not read. DENY skips. ALLOW skips own exposure/sea/canSeeSky branch and restRNG threshold only; does not skip global/hostile/insomnia/timer/spectator/localdifficulty/block/factory/admission. Event documentation alwaysspawn is not literal caller guarantee.",
    "Full62line DifficultyInstance computes effectivePeaceful0 and otherwisebase/time/inhabited/moon terms; isHarderThan strict>. ALLOW still retains effectiveDifficulty>randomFloat*3; no static HARD-only or guaranteed event spawn. Input provider/current local values/RNG/world not fully audited.",
    "ActualserverplayergetStats field→CUSTOM TIME_SINCE_REST read→clamp1..maxint. Stat read occurs evenALLOW before test. DEFAULT nextInt(j)>=72000 has no positive-domain result forj<=72000, first possiblej72001 not guaranteed threeday encounter; unusedk24000 nosecondtimer. Generic stats helper not separate policy.",
    "BoundedPlayer server tick awardsrest1 while !sleeping outside own isAlive gate used bydeathcounter. Player ResourceLocation→CUSTOM→award1 dispatch plus actualServerPlayer override reachesstats.increment. CompleteStatsCounter upper-saturateslongsum atmaxint and default0map; no lower saturation claimed for arbitrary negative updates. Normal tick positive1 only. Fulltick/crossmoddelivery not audited.",
    "ActualServerPlayer startSleeping resetsrest0 before super; shownPlayer/ServerPlayer death code resetsrest too. These are reached branch semantics, not proof sleeping succeeded/completednight/deathhappened/offlineelapsed. Constructor getsstats throughPlayerList; getStats returnsfield. Actualstats.setValue updatesmap anddirty; partialServerStatsCounter constructor/savecatches IOException but parseLocal/toJson/PlayerListidentity/actualfile/Clone not read. Currentcounter consumer≠reliable save/migration entitlement.",
